<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-3515] NullPointerException when stopping IgniteSemaphore and no method has been called previously to initialize semaphore with initializeSemaphore().</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-3515</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;IgniteSemaphore stop() method does not check if internal synchronization object &apos;sync&apos; is null hence null pointer exception is thrown.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
